<title>USA: HF Financial sets 10 pct stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>HF Financial sets 10 pct stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS, S.D. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>HF Financial Corp said on Wednesday its board had authorized the company to repurchase up to 10 percent of its common stock beginning May 1, 1997 through April 30, 1998.</p>
<p>Purchases would be made periodically either in the open market or in private transactions, in accordance with regulatory guidelines including volume limits, it said.</p>
<p>HF Financial said the board believed the company was generating free capital in excess of the amount needed to fund its business.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
